<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Caspian Darts, 2018</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;FONT face="Microsoft Sans Serif"&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Berlin Sans FB Demi",sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;U&gt;Caspian Darts&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt" align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Berlin Sans FB Demi",sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt'&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Berlin Sans FB Demi",sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Location:&lt;/STRONG&gt; Ancient Anatolia and the&amp;nbsp;Caspian&amp;nbsp;Sea&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Berlin Sans FB Demi",sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Date/Time:&lt;/STRONG&gt; October 25, 2018 0900 Hours&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Berlin Sans FB Demi",sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Playable Sides:&lt;/STRONG&gt; USA (elements USAF and USN)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Berlin Sans FB Demi",sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Berlin Sans FB Demi",sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Berlin Sans FB Demi",sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Description:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Berlin Sans FB Demi",sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Berlin Sans FB Demi",sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;The Caspian holds large energy resources both tapped and under development. Territorial claims and ambiguities fester amongst the nations bordering the inland sea.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;Russia's modernized Caspian flotilla just announced another “Flash Exercise” that began roughly 3 hours ago. NATO is on alert. The USN has a small group of observers on the Caspian shore&amp;nbsp;in Azerbaijan. Russian backed rebels are shelling the disputed Nagorno-Karabakh region. Begin patroling, remain flexible and await developments as they unfold via in-game messages. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;Avoid spoilers: Please send feedback to &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;A href="mailto:kevinkin@comcast.net"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;kevinkin@comcast.net&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;. Thanks.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
